#==============================================================================================
#
#   abort_signal - DOM::AbortSignal: abort reasons, abort algorithms and dependent signals
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/DOM/AbortSignal.cpp (lines 1-232) and AbortSignal.h (lines
#       1-90): adding and removing abort algorithms, signalling abort (running the abort steps
#       and firing `abort`), the static abort()/timeout()/any() and creating a dependent abort
#       signal. An abort reason is a JS value; a DOMException reason is the exception as a JS
#       object value (DESIGN.md §3.6).
